# Single Project ID Environment Variable
RULE: Use GCP_PROJECT_ID as primary. Config classes may support GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT for backward compat.
WHY: Multiple vars (GCP_PROJECT_ID, GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT) cause confusion and wrong config loading.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/README.md#configuration, .cursorrules
DO: Document GCP_PROJECT_ID first; use AliasChoices for compat; validate non-empty
NEVER: Use PROJECT_ID (too generic); document GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT as primary
